<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-26T20:40:34.465Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:40:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan has launched airstrikes and ground attacks against militants in southern Syria, citing retaliation for a deadly church attack that killed nine people. Syrian authorities have imposed new restrictions on women, banning them from university courses and limiting admission to security-focused universities, while a delegation from the Interior Ministry attended a security university graduation in Riyadh. A car bomb on the Damascus-Homs highway killed several people, and a separate drone strike on the same highway killed three individuals, according to defense sources. Additionally, a target linked to Abu Abdul Rahman al-Libi was reportedly engaged near Qara in Syria.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNME5nVlVFak1QaWYxX1dDcm1HS3A4dHlLS1NkdmItbW9WUE1OS0NsY2U0VDhTN3NCSDVlcjhMNnNwekE2N0xGYkpqMmhOU3NCVzdzMkZRMll5MDJzck1UYlQ3NEMyTmJYZVNJVVh6ajhjQmJlU19OaTRjQ3JocUdJT0Nja3labkZ1OFFfQWpYbXRicS16aFJERHJxUktDWXF0X2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Traverse City Record-Eagle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQRDB6dXlrRlp2YWhLUHFULV9LdlBrbHBfbTVIaUJFTGlxOFJZalptdnFSV2Z2aEFnMTV4aTZFQVhPT2k0cmNoSUVOZFJZTUpQMjVFbkRWZ2RtRlVaekFKV1VuWnZhQjFWRFFWcHlPZEFjVURXSG5LYnFtcmdaaEh2YXE1MUtpZkZEUFJtYnNTSjlTMmgtNE5obDBzaTc2UEdCZnNjcGs5cVBJaHotVWtiV3MwdEQzMHZocW1RRjhlSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News PK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;A News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Corsicana Daily Sun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.googl